Machine explosions (whether caused by weather or voltage factors) can produce a lot of pollution;

Every time the multi-block machine runs, it will emit pollution according to the level of its muffler chamber, and as the muffler chamber is upgraded, the amount of pollution emissions will decrease.

pollution effect

