用途\n\n有源变压器能够灵活地根据需求重新分配电力，让玩家摆脱布线和变压之苦。:
Purpose

Active transformers can flexibly redistribute power according to demand, freeing players from the hassle of wiring and voltage transformation.

The current total power input power and total power output power can be obtained in real time through the GUI of the active transformer.
Operating mechanism

The priority of power distribution by active transformers follows: ordinary energy warehouse (energy warehouse, power warehouse) > substation energy warehouse (substation energy warehouse, substation power warehouse) > laser warehouse (laser target warehouse, laser source warehouse).

Utilizing active transformers to redistribute power does not cause any power loss.

Before dismantling or changing any structure of the active transformer, the machine must be shut down, otherwise it will cause the machine to explode violently with an explosion power of 12.When the active transformer status meets any of the following conditions, it is determined to be shut down:

No power input or power output detected;

None of the power inputs have any power buffering;

The actual total power buffer at the power output is higher than the total power capacity;

