Soon, a race came to live here, led by the powerful druid "Revil O' Elcanrab", who and his followers wanted to harness the power of the Nether as a tool for creation;

However, when they opened the portal, evil forces poured in uncontrollably, causing corruption to spread and the people of the interdimensional world to be transformed into ghosts;

Some of the Druid's followers managed to escape to the Overworld, but were driven into madness by the influence of nether powers;

The powerful Druid himself becomes the leader of the Shades, destined to rule a decaying empire as any remaining humanity in him slowly fades away;

